# Completed benchmark

Sampled rolling origins, not all days. 2022 development and 2023 held-out year use frozen parameters; historical target context updates as time advances. Chronos pretraining overlap is unknown. Dates are only partially officially verified. One Diwali per year; no causal or publication-ready claim. Newer source is not silently substituted.

